{"id":"a1ecad6e276ba716","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-proof-rule-instance.md","title":"Proof Rule Instance","display":"df-proof-rule-instance — Proof Rule Instance","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-proof-rule-instance","aliases":["72-df-proof-rule-instance"],"display":"df-proof-rule-instance — Proof Rule Instance","depends_on":["[[72-df-sequent-rule]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.I §§1.2.1–1.2.2; print10–12/PDF22–24; explicit local encoding","verification_status":"source-statement-checked; explicit local encoding checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-proof-rule-instance"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-proof-rule-instance</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-proof-rule-instance — Proof Rule Instance"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d940a4cbbc0bf9c9\" href=\"?note=d940a4cbbc0bf9c9\" title=\"72-df-sequent-rule\">72-df-sequent-rule</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.I §§1.2.1–1.2.2; print10–12/PDF22–24; explicit local encoding"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked; explicit local encoding checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q=\\mathrm{Seq}(\\Sigma)\">\\(Q=\\mathrm{Seq}(\\Sigma)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\in\\omega\\cup\\{\\omega\\}\">\\(I\\in\\omega\\cup\\{\\omega\\}\\)</span>；规则模式由已给定集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span>、实例化函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:M\\to Q^I\">\\(p:M\\to Q^I\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c:M\\to Q\">\\(c:M\\to Q\\)</span> 和合法参数集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\\subseteq M\">\\(E\\subseteq M\\)</span> 编码，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R=\\langle M,E,p,c\\rangle\">\\(R=\\langle M,E,p,c\\rangle\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span> 是固定规则标签，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w:M\\to W\">\\(w:M\\to W\\)</span> 是固定见证提取函数。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in E\\ \\to\\ R[\\sigma]:=\\langle p(\\sigma),c(\\sigma)\\rangle.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\sigma\\in E\\ \\to\\ R[\\sigma]:=\\langle p(\\sigma),c(\\sigma)\\rangle.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Inst}(R):=\\{\\langle p(\\sigma),c(\\sigma)\\rangle:\\sigma\\in E\\},\\qquad\\operatorname{TInst}(t,R,w):=\\{\\langle t,w(\\sigma),p(\\sigma),c(\\sigma)\\rangle:\\sigma\\in E\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Inst}(R):=\\{\\langle p(\\sigma),c(\\sigma)\\rangle:\\sigma\\in E\\},\\qquad\\operatorname{TInst}(t,R,w):=\\{\\langle t,w(\\sigma),p(\\sigma),c(\\sigma)\\rangle:\\sigma\\in E\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>sort及本征变量条件通过已给定参数集E保留；这是参数化规则模式的具体关系表示。LK具体规则没有依靠一个空白的“sort-correct”谓词，而在各个集合构造里给出取值范围和副条件。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-sequent-rule","status":"resolved","id":"d940a4cbbc0bf9c9","anchor":"ref-1","tar